at this glorious footage.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:10.720
Yes, this is a scene with 1 billion. Can that&nbsp;
really be? Well, I can hardly believe it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:18.880
but here it is. Look, that is a beautiful&nbsp;
simulation. I love it. Now, this technique is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:26.000
