it also does it faster than previous techniques.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:33.440
The speedup factor is typically 3x, but&nbsp;
not on honey buckling scenes. Why is that?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:38.080
Well, the more viscous the fluids&nbsp;
are, at the risk of simplification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:43.760
